  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5728,
      "text": "when his Lord called out to him at the sacred valley of Tuwa?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5729,
      "text": "[Saying,] “Go to Pharaoh, for he has transgressed all bounds”.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5730,
      "text": "And say: ‘Are you willing to be purified,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5731,
      "text": "and I will guide you to your Lord so that you may fear Him?’”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5732,
      "text": "Then Moses showed him the greatest sign[9].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5733,
      "text": "But Pharaoh denied it and disobeyed.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5734,
      "text": "Then he turned back striving to plot.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5735,
      "text": "He gathered [his people] and proclaimed,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5736,
      "text": "saying, “I am your lord, the most high.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5737,
      "text": "So Allah seized him for an exemplary punishment in this life and in the Hereafter[10].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5738,
      "text": "Indeed, there is a lesson in this for those who fear Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5739,
      "text": "Are you more difficult to create or the heaven that He built?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5740,
      "text": "He raised its vault high and proportioned it,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5741,
      "text": "and darkened its night and brought forth its daylight.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5742,
      "text": "And thereafter He spread out the earth,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5743,
      "text": "brought forth from it its water and its pasture,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5744,
      "text": "and set the mountains firmly,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5745,
      "text": "as a provision for you and your grazing livestock.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5746,
      "text": "But when the Supreme Calamity comes[11],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5747,
      "text": "on that Day man will remember all what he did,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5748,
      "text": "and the Blazing Fire will be exposed for all to see.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5749,
      "text": "As for those who transgressed,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5750,
      "text": "and preferred the life of this world,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5751,
      "text": "the Blazing Fire will be their abode.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5752,
      "text": "But those who feared standing before their Lord and restrained themselves from evil desires,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5753,
      "text": "Paradise will surely be their abode.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5754,
      "text": "They ask you concerning the Hour, “When will it be[12]?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5755,
      "text": "How could you possibly mention that?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5756,
      "text": "Its knowledge rests only with your Lord[13].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5757,
      "text": "You are only a warner for those who fear it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5758,
      "text": "On the Day when they see it[14], it will be as if they had remained [in this world] no more than an evening or a morning.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
